# Frontend CSS Modules

Admin UI styles use CSS Modules + `--hcms-*` tokens. Do not add Tailwind or utility `className` strings.

## Files

- Co-locate: `ComponentName.module.css` (or `.module.scss`) next to the component.
- Name matches the exported component (`Button.module.css` for `Button`).
- Import: `import styles from './Button.module.css'`.

## Flat CSS only

- No nested selectors (`&:hover` blocks, `.parent .child` blocks).
- Modifiers are sibling classes: `.navLink`, `.navLinkActive`, `.navLink:hover` as top-level rules.
- Dark mode via token values on `:root` / `.dark` — not per-component color forks when tokens cover it.

## Tokens (from `frontend/src/index.css`)

- Spacing: `--hcms-SPx1` … `--hcms-SPx14` (4px step → 4…56px).
- Radius: `--hcms-CRx1` … `--hcms-CRx5` (4px step → 4…20px).
- Colors: `--hcms-color-*` only in modules. No raw hex/rgb for theme colors/spacing/radius.

## Composition

```tsx
className={clsx(styles.root, isActive && styles.rootActive, className)}
```

Variants = separate classes (`variantDefault`, `sizeSm`), composed with `clsx` / `cn`.
